{"uid":"40b6217dce96c413","name":"test_a_refused_interrupt_leaves_no_steering_message_behind","fullName":"tests.test_interrupt_wake_task028b#test_a_refused_interrupt_leaves_no_steering_message_behind","historyId":"98ea4c46be24ea898f1b5ce4988401bb","time":{"start":1791959659671,"stop":1791959659691,"duration":20},"description":"The exact `deck-phase4c` shape: a `{\"message\": ...}` body accompanies\n    a request against an already-finished run. The pre-028b handler\n    enqueued the message via `run.add_steering` and only THEN refused with\n    409 -- the caller was told the request failed about a message that had,\n    in fact, landed. `finished()` now gates first, so nothing is enqueued at\n    all: the steering ledger before and after the refusal is identical.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The exact <code>deck-phase4c</code> shape: a <code>{&quot;message&quot;: ...}</code> body accompanies<br />\na request against an already-finished run. The pre-028b handler<br />\nenqueued the message via <code>run.add_steering</code> and only THEN refused with<br />\n409 -- the caller was told the request failed about a message that had,<br />\nin fact, landed. <code>finished()</code> now gates first, so nothing is enqueued at<br />\nall: the steering ledger before and after the refusal is identical.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791959389106,"stop":1791959389106,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791959389106,"stop":1791959389106,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_asyncio